# Optional. Point this at a model API that the browser cannot reach directly —
# typically one running on this machine whose CORS preflight does not name the
# Authorization header, which browsers refuse regardless of client code.
#
# With this set, `npm run dev` serves the API from its own origin, so there is
# no cross-origin request left to block. Use this Base URL in the app:
#
#   http://127.0.0.1:5173/proxy-api/v1
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and edit the value.
API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:20128
